span><span><span><strong>申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p></li></ol><p><span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>国内高校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生，在本科学校可取得推荐免试研究生资格</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无有违学术道德等行为</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>身心健康</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>英语水平良好</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>、</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>申请流程</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>．系统报名要求</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）登录东南大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"http://gsas.seu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://gsas.seu.edu.cn</a></span></span><span><span><span>，以下简称“系统”），选择“</span></span></span><span><span><span>全</span></span></span><span><span>国优秀大学生预推免”项目。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2